  "limitations": [
    "One explicit debug-only fixture runs on a disposable Android13/API33 x86_64 emulator with targetSdk35, not on Thor or ARM64. Its ordinary sibling APK is independently verified to exclude the service, fixture DEX marker and source asset.",
    "The real owner process in the private :handoffProbe service self-terminates in five phases. Instrumentation observes each Binder death and a changed owner instance, then production LocalAccountHandoff/LocalHandoffRecovery recognize and recover known states while preserving unknown stages and settings/account siblings.",
    "Same-JVM and cross-process active-owner duplication are refused; original bytes remain unchanged, release succeeds and subsequent creation/close is preserved. These are actual instrumented assertions, not host-mocked process-death results.",
    "The main application process is not restarted. A two-byte nonexecuted MZ file only supplies the handoff fixture owned launch-view filename; no WoW executable, Wine, PRoot, local services, account SQL, imported game assets or gameplay runs.",
    "Build-only evidence keeps androidExecutionQualified false; this additive source-bound runtime receipt alone qualifies the narrower Android x64 handoff recovery path. It does not qualify the production runtime or a playable APK.",
    "The original source companion, ordinary/probe/test APKs and all bounded evidence members were read in full. The complete archive is byte-identical to locally regenerated canonical Git archive 7c303665:1039 files match exact blobs; gradlew.bat has only the committed six-separator LF-to-CRLF export conversion. All14 source-bound build input identities and the strict committed-source admission guard pass in a separate canonical extraction.",
    "Only source evidence, fixed scope flags, validated receipt fields and bounded diagnostic identities are exported. No private credentials, handoff record/proof bytes, owner UUIDs or supplied process identifiers are added to this proof."
  ],
